	(descr "Milliohm HoLSX2512 bare alloy (6J06) current sense resistor, recommended land pattern with Kelvin sense vias in the pads, for the Device:R_Shunt symbol: current pads 1 / 4 = 1.8 x 3.4 mm, 3.4 mm apart (L 7, A 3.4, B 3.4), sense pads 2 / 3 = 0.3/0.6 mm vias at x -/+2.05 (inner end of the 1.2 mm terminal), tented on B.Cu, to be filled and capped. Net-tie groups 1-2 and 3-4. Source: Milliohm acknowledgement letter HoS20260331-76 rev. A0 (HoLSX2512-6W-0.2mR-1%): body W 6.4+/-0.3 A 3.2+/-0.3 H 1.9+/-0.3 mm, terminal T 1.2+/-0.5 (p.3), pads (p.6). F.Cu keepout between terminals. 3D: KiCad generic R_2512_6332Metric (lower than the real 1.9 mm part). YESC: HoLSX2512-6W-0.2mR-1%, 0.2 mOhm 1% +/-100ppm 6W, LCSC C19270873.")
	(tags "resistor shunt current sense Kelvin 4-terminal net tie via in pad Milliohm HoLSX2512 2512 bare alloy")
